<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xilinx upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xilinx upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Corp said Thursday it had upgraded Xilinx Corp to buy from hold on a short-term basis, while maintaining a long-term buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Scott Randall said in a research note he raised his fiscal 1998 earnings estimate to $1.85 per share from $1.80, and raised his fiscal 1999 estimate to $2.45 from $2.18.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Xilinx shares were up 1-3/4 at 47.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
